# BUILD RULE

Every batch follows:

1. Complete Bible chapters
2. Approval
3. Lock chapters
4. Generate owned files only
5. Create database objects only if owned
6. Create API only if owned
7. Create tests only if owned
8. Acceptance test
9. Update BUILD_STATUS.md
10. Update CURRENT_BUILD_TARGET.md

No file may exist unless listed in this document or authorized by the Canonical File Registry.

